<title>NETHERLANDS: ARTU SEES 96/97 GROSS 0.5 MLN GUILDERS.</title>
<headline>ARTU SEES 96/97 GROSS 0.5 MLN GUILDERS.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch biotech firm Artu Biologicals said on Friday it expected its gross profits and turnover to increase in the 1996/1997 bookyear. It gave no net profit figures.</p>
<p>&quot;For the whole bookyear management expects a turnover growth of around 10 percent and an increase in profit before tax to around 500,000 guilders from 290,000 in 1995/1996,&quot; the company said in a statement..</p>
